Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Staging|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	Then Page add
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Activate Staging Page Versioning With Custom Default Language
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|Staging#ActivateStagingPageVersioningWithCustomDefaultLanguage|
	When Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Private Staging Page|
		|sitePagePrivacy|Private|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Site Settings|
	And Site configure Current Languages CP
		|currentSiteLanguages|English (United States)|
		|defaultSiteLanguage|English (United States)|
		|displaySettings|Display Settings|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Publishing
		|portlet|Staging|
	Then Staging activate Staging CP
		|pageVersioningEnabled|true|
		|siteName|Site Name|
Scenario: Delete Publish Template
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Site Settings|
	And Site disable Recycle Bin CP
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Publishing
		|portlet|Staging|
	And Staging activate Staging CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Publishing
		|portlet|Staging|
	And Staging add Publish Template
		|publishTemplateDescription|Publish Template Description|
		|publishTemplateName|Publish Template Name|
	And Staging save Publish Template
		|publishTemplateDescription|Publish Template Description|
		|publishTemplateName|Publish Template Name|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator goto Staged View
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Publishing
		|portlet|Staging|
	Then Staging delete Publish Template
		|publishTemplateName|Publish Template Name|
